---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CertificationBadges from '../../components/ui/CertificationBadges.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="py-12 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">Utility & Grid-Scale Storage</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">
        MWh to GWh. Frequency regulation. Renewable firming. Grid stabilization. Black start capability.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary inline-block">Contact Grid Solutions Team →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl my-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <div class="text-5xl mb-4">🏗️</div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">The grid is changing. Storage is the answer.</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg">Renewable integration, aging infrastructure, and growing demand require flexible, fast-responding energy storage. Vestwoods delivers at utility scale.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12">Grid-Scale Applications</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="border rounded-xl p-6"><div class="text-3xl mb-3">⚡</div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Frequency Regulation</h3><p class="text-gray-600">Sub-second response to grid frequency deviations. Replace gas peakers with cleaner, faster storage.</p></div>
        <div class="border rounded-xl p-6"><div class="text-3xl mb-3">☀️</div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Renewable Firming</h3><p class="text-gray-600">Shift solar and wind energy to evening peaks. Smooth intermittent generation.</p></div>
        <div class="border rounded-xl p-6"><div class="text-3xl mb-3">🏥</div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Transmission & Distribution Deferral</h3><p class="text-gray-600">Avoid costly substation and line upgrades. Defer capital expenditures by 5-10 years.</p></div>
        <div class="border rounded-xl p-6"><div class="text-3xl mb-3">🔋</div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Black Start Capability</h3><p class="text-gray-600">Restore grid after blackout without external power. Critical for grid resilience.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl my-8">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12">Technical Specifications</h2>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6">
        <table class="w-full">
          <tr class="border-b"><td class="py-3 font-semibold">Containerized Solutions</td><td class="py-3">20ft, 40ft ISO containers | 500kWh – 5MWh per unit</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b"><td class="py-3 font-semibold">Scalability</td><td class="py-3">Parallel up to 1GWh+ per site</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b"><td class="py-3 font-semibold">Response Time</td><td class="py-3">&lt;50ms to full power</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b"><td class="py-3 font-semibold">Round-trip Efficiency</td><td class="py-3">≥92% (AC to AC)</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="py-3 font-semibold">Grid Code Compliance</td><td class="py-3">IEEE 1547, UL 1741 SA, IEC 61727, local grid codes</td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8">Utility-Grade Safety & Reliability</h2>
      <CertificationBadges />
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-4">All systems meet NERC, FERC, and regional reliability standards</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl my-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-8">Reference Project Placeholder</h2>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6">
        <div class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">[Utility Name / Project Name]</div>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">[Location] | [XX] MW / [XX] MWh</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4">
          <div><span class="font-bold text-blue-600">[XX]%</span><br />Frequency regulation accuracy</div>
          <div><span class="font-bold text-blue-600">$[XX]M</span><br />Annual grid savings</div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-700 italic">"[REPLACE: Add actual project outcome – improved reliability, reduced curtailment, deferred upgrade]"</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-8">FAQ for Utilities & IPPs</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="border-b pb-4"><h3 class="font-semibold">What's the typical project timeline?</h3><p class="text-gray-600">12-18 months from PPA execution to COD for 10-100MWh projects.</p></div>
        <div class="border-b pb-4"><h3 class="font-semibold">Do you offer turnkey EPC?</h3><p class="text-gray-600">[REPLACE: Yes/No – and what partners you work with]</p></div>
        <div class="border-b pb-4"><h3 class="font-semibold">What software platform do you use?</h3><p class="text-gray-600">[REPLACE: EMS, DERMS, or third-party integration capabilities]</p></div>
        <div class="pb-4"><h3 class="font-semibold">Can you handle merchant or contracted revenue stacking?</h3><p class="text-gray-600">[REPLACE: Describe ability to stack energy arbitrage, ancillary services, capacity market, and resource adequacy]</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-2xl my-8 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Ready to discuss your utility-scale project?</h2>
      <p class="text-blue-100 mb-8">Contact our grid solutions team for a technical and commercial proposal.</p>
      <a href="/contact?product=utility" class="bg-white text-blue-600 px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-semibold inline-block">Contact Grid Team →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>